__pycache__/

# Build artifacts. Removing these is also how a packaging defect becomes
# visible: a wheel built beside a stale egg-info inherits its file list.
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
*.gate.lock*

# Per-tool agent harness state. Each harness drops its own configuration into
# the checkout, and the generators recreate it on demand -- bd setup codex and
# bd setup cursor write .codex/ and .cursor/ from scratch -- so keep it out of
# the tree rather than advertising support this project never exercises.
# Anchored to the root: a directory named .claude/ deeper in the tree would be
# something else, and should be noticed rather than silently ignored.  Contrast
# .dolt/ above, which is deliberately unanchored because beads keeps a real one
# at .beads/embeddeddolt/.
#
# The sibling directories .omp/, .beads/ and .agents/ are excluded from
# .git/info/exclude instead, because init-project.sh registers them there in the
# same step that creates them.  The harnesses below register nothing, so leaving
# them to a local exclude file would hand every contributor a dirty git status
# to clean up by hand.
/.claude/
/.codex/
/.cursor/
/.serena/
